<title>UK: UK M0 grows provisional 6.1 pct in year to May.</title>
<headline>UK M0 grows provisional 6.1 pct in year to May.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England released the following provisional data on M0 money supply -</p>
<p>    MONEY SUPPLY (in pct)	    MAY		 APRIL</p>
<p>    M0 in month (adjusted)	  +0.3		 +0.2</p>
<p>    M0 annual (adjusted)	    +6.1		 +6.0</p>
<p>    M0 in month (unadjusted)	+1.2		 +0.9</p>
<p>    M0 annual (unadjusted)	  +6.2		 +5.1</p>
<p>NOTE - consensus forecast 6.5 pct yr/yr s/adj growth.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5109</p>
</text>
